Liquid need 3 parts to work:
1. Objects: These are the variables that hold data. They are denoted by double curly braces, like {{ variable_name }}.
2. Tags: These are the logic that controls the flow of the template. They are denoted by {% tag_name %}.
3. Filters: These are used to modify the output of objects. They are denoted by a pipe symbol, like {{ variable_name | filter_name }}.


